  "description": "# 🎗 Mystic Alliance\nEST. September 4, 24\n \nMystic Alliance is a community-driven guild group, dedicated to exploring the vast expanse of **[IdleMMO]**. Our members are passionate players who value teamwork, strategy, and camaraderie. We strive to create a welcoming environment for players of all skill levels, fostering growth and collaboration.  \n\n## 📅 Activities\n\n\n\n\n## 🔆 Requirements\n- ### ⚔️ Combat level 92+ to participate in LvL. 92 raids\n- 🔔 Active participation challenges\n- 💬 Respectful communication and behaviour\n- 📑 Applications only via the Discord Server\n\nIf you do not match the requirements, check out our trainings guild **Mystic Wayfarer**\n\n## 🎁 Benefits\n- 🤖 World boss notification bot\n- 🗂️ Collection of resources\n- 🔧 Forging and Alchemy services\n- 🎁 Giveaways (Tools, Gear, Mats, Membership,...)\n- 🪙 Public market with lower prices\n- 💵 Loaning system\n\n## 🏛 Guilds\n- Mystic Vanguard\n- Mystic Crusader\n- Mystic Dawn \n- Mystic Wayfarer [Trainer]\n- Mystic Abyss [Cursed]\n\n## ⭕️ Discord is mandatory\n#### https://discord.gg/Ndz4eNPECy\n\nVisit the server, enter the queue and\n# ❇️ JOIN US NOW",
